{
  "id": 562,
  "description": "Templars is a casual guild but some activity is expected. For current raids you need Combat Level 60 to join.\n\n\nIf possible, please try and help to complete daily challenges by helping with making the necessary contributions. That said, there are no expectations to buy items from the market in order to do so. \n\n\n\nRAID schedules will be at 08:00/14:00/20:00 UTC if we have the required Marks to launch them. If we don’t have the Marks needed for a raid time slot it will be skipped till we do. Please try and join the raids if possible. Remember, if you join a raid, do not leave it until it’s finished as you will not receive the rewards if you leave early.\n\nDuring seasonal campaigns like Yule Fest we will run the seasonal raid, rather than the normal ones, for the duration of the campaign unless the seasonal raid is on a cool-down timer. Additionally, we will run an 4th raid at 02:00 due to the low cost.",
